    89	    /// Banks what the sensor saw onto the workout and ends the session.
    90	    ///
    91	    /// Called on every path that ends a workout — finish, templated finish,
    92	    /// cancel, and the "finish it and start new" recovery in `StartWorkoutView`,
    93	    /// which previously had no access to the monitor at all and so could neither
    94	    /// save the vitals nor stop the sensor.
    95	    func end(_ workout: Workout, capture: Bool = true) {
