     5		<!-- Partial Info.plist, MERGED with the generated one.
     6	
     7		     GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE stays YES: every usage-description string and
     8		     the scene manifest still live in build settings, exactly as before.
     9		     This file exists for one key that build settings cannot express.
    10	
    11		     Xcode's plist generator only writes an allowlist of INFOPLIST_KEY_*
    12		     settings, and array-valued keys are not on it. Setting
    13		     INFOPLIST_KEY_UIBackgroundModes = audio is silently accepted, appears
    14		     in -showBuildSettings, and never reaches the built plist — verified
    15		     2026-08-24 with `plutil -extract` on the built app.
    16	
    17		     Why the app needs it: the rest alarm plays real audio so the sound
    18		     reaches AirPods (a UNNotificationSound does not). The moment that
    19		     matters most is the screen being off mid-workout, and starting
    20		     playback from the background requires this mode. Without it
    21		     AVAudioSession activation fails there and the alarm is silent again —
    22		     the exact bug it was added to fix. -->
    23		<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
    24		<array>
    25			<!-- Plays the rest alarm while the app is backgrounded. -->
    26			<string>audio</string>
    27			<!-- Keeps the HKWorkoutSession RUNNING while the app is backgrounded,
    28			     which on iOS it does not do without this.
    29	
    30			     Found the hard way, 2026-08-25: with `audio` alone the alarm beeped
    31			     only while the app was on screen. iOS suspends the workout session
    32			     when the app backgrounds, so no samples arrive, so the sample-driven
    33			     alarm never fires — and every SwiftUI timer has stopped too.
    34	
    35			     The local notification kept firing throughout, which is what made
    36			     this hard to see: a UNTimeIntervalNotificationTrigger is scheduled
    37			     with the system in advance and fires whether or not the app is
    38			     running. The notification arriving never proved the app was alive. -->
    39			<string>workout-processing</string>
    40		</array>
